dd separator":["P\u0159idat odd\u011blova\u010d"],"Label (optional)":["Popisek (voliteln\u00e9)"],"(no label)":["(bez popisku)"],"Warning":["Varov\u00e1n\u00ed"],"All types":["V\u0161echny typy"],"Success":["\u00dasp\u011bch"],"State":["Stav"],"Try again":["Zkusit znovu"],"Hiding an item only removes it from the menu: the page still opens when its address is typed in. To refuse it too, switch on \"Block access to hidden pages\" in the Settings tab (users who can manage options are never blocked).":["Skryt\u00ed polo\u017eky ji jen odebere z menu: str\u00e1nka se d\u00e1l otev\u0159e po zad\u00e1n\u00ed jej\u00ed adresy. Aby byla odm\u00edtnuta i tak, zapn\u011bte v z\u00e1lo\u017ece Nastaven\u00ed \u201eZablokovat p\u0159\u00edstup ke skryt\u00fdm str\u00e1nk\u00e1m\u201c (u\u017eivatel\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed sm\u011bj\u00ed spravovat nastaven\u00ed, se neblokuj\u00ed nikdy)."],"Switched on by the migration from the plugin %1$s (%2$s). %1$s blocked hidden pages, so the lock is switched on here too. You can switch it off.":["Zapnuto migrac\u00ed z pluginu %1$s (%2$s). %1$s skryt\u00e9 str\u00e1nky blokoval, proto je blokace zapnut\u00e1 i tady. M\u016f\u017eete ji vypnout."],"Open the migration history":["Otev\u0159\u00edt historii migrac\u00ed"],"Blocking of hidden pages: on (from the migration of %s)":["Blokace skryt\u00fdch str\u00e1nek: zapnuta (z migrace %s)"],"Blocking of hidden pages: on":["Blokace skryt\u00fdch str\u00e1nek: zapnuta"],"Blocking of hidden pages: off":["Blokace skryt\u00fdch str\u00e1nek: vypnuta"],"Required capability":["Po\u017eadovan\u00e9 opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u00ed"],"Always show to these users":["V\u017edy zobrazit t\u011bmto u\u017eivatel\u016fm"],"Never show to these users":["Nikdy nezobrazit t\u011bmto u\u017eivatel\u016fm"],"Everybody":["V\u0161ichni"],"Sub-items and advanced rules":["Podpolo\u017eky a pokro\u010dil\u00e1 pravidla"],"Open an item to rename, hide, move or re-order its sub-items, to require a capability, or to show or hide an item for single users (by login). Rules of users and capabilities apply on top of the role limits above. Users who can manage options always keep UX Studio, Plugins, Users and Settings. With \"Block access to hidden pages\" on, hidden sub-items are refused by address too.":["Otev\u0159ete polo\u017eku, abyste p\u0159ejmenovali, skryli, p\u0159esunuli nebo se\u0159adili jej\u00ed podpolo\u017eky, vy\u017eadovali opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u00ed nebo polo\u017eku zobrazili \u010di skryli jednotliv\u00fdm u\u017eivatel\u016fm (podle p\u0159ihla\u0161ovac\u00edho jm\u00e9na). Pravidla pro u\u017eivatele a opr\u00e1vn\u011bn\u00ed plat\u00ed nav\u00edc k omezen\u00edm rol\u00ed v\u00fd\u0161e. U\u017eivatel\u00e9, kte\u0159\u00ed sm\u011bj\u00ed spravovat nastaven\u00ed, v\u017edy zachovaj\u00ed UX Studio, Pluginy, U\u017eivatele a Nastaven\u00ed. Kdy\u017e je zapnut\u00e9 \u201eZablokovat p\u0159\u00edstup ke skryt\u00fdm str\u00e1nk\u00e1m\u201c, skryt\u00e9 podpolo\u017eky se odm\u00edtnou i po zad\u00e1n\u00ed adresy."],"The item itself":["Samotn\u00e1 polo\u017eka"],"Rename":["P\u0159ejmenovat"],"New title of %s":["Nov\u00fd n\u00e1zev polo\u017eky %s"],"Move %s under":["P\u0159esunout %s pod"],"(stays here)":["(z\u016fst\u00e1v\u00e1 tady)"],"Hidden for roles":["Skryto pro role"],"Nobody":["Nikdo"],"User logins, separated by commas.":["P\u0159ihla\u0161ovac\u00ed jm\u00e9na u\u017eivatel\u016f, odd\u011blen\u00e1 \u010d\u00e1rkami."],"Renamed to %s":["P\u0159ejmenov\u00e1no na %s"],"moved under %s":["p\u0159esunuto pod %s"],"hidden for everybody":["skryto pro v\u0161echny"],"hidden for %s":["skryto pro %s"],"needs %s":["vy\u017eaduje %s"],"always shown to: %s":["v\u017edy zobrazeno: %s"],"never shown to: %s":["nikdy zobrazeno: %s"],"No changes":["Beze zm\u011bn"],"Move %s up":["Posunout %s nahoru"],"Move %s down":["Posunout %s dol\u016f"],"Show less":["Zobrazit m\u00e9n\u011b"],"Information":["Informace"],"Gone":["Zmizel\u00e1"],"Last 7 days":["Posledn\u00edch 7 dn\u00ed"],"Last 30 days":["Posledn\u00edch 30 dn\u00ed"],"All time":["Za celou dobu"],"Something went wrong.":["N\u011bco se nepovedlo."],"Unknown source":["Nezn\u00e1m\u00fd zdroj"],"user #%d":["u\u017eivatel \u010d. %d"],"Select notice: %s":["Vybrat upozorn\u011bn\u00ed: %s"],"Show full text":["Zobrazit cel\u00e9"],"The source is an estimate based on the look and wording of the notice.":["Zdroj je odhad podle vzhledu a zn\u011bn\u00ed upozorn\u011bn\u00ed."],"estimate":["odhad"],"First seen: %s":["Poprv\u00e9: %s"],"Last seen: %s":["Naposledy: %s"],"Shown %d\u00d7":["Zobrazeno %d\u00d7"],"Came back %d time":["Znovu se objevilo %d\u00d7","Znovu se objevilo %d\u00d7","Znovu se objevilo %d\u00d7"],"Closed by %1$s, %2$s":["Zav\u0159el(a) %1$s, %2$s"],"someone":["n\u011bkdo"],"Closed by the plugin, cannot be restored":["Zav\u0159eno pluginem, nelze obnovit"],"Show in panel again":["Znovu zobrazit v panelu"],"Delete record":["Smazat z\u00e1znam"],"The notice will appear in the panel again on the next page load.":["Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed se v panelu znovu objev\u00ed p\u0159i dal\u0161\u00edm na\u010dten\u00ed str\u00e1nky."],"The notice panel is off":["Panel upozorn\u011bn\u00ed je vypnut\u00fd"],"Hiding of admin notices is off":["Skr\u00fdv\u00e1n\u00ed upozorn\u011bn\u00ed v administraci je vypnut\u00e9"],"Notices are hidden completely, not moved to the panel under the bell. New notices are not recorded.":["Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed se skr\u00fdvaj\u00ed \u00fapln\u011b, nep\u0159esouvaj\u00ed se do panelu pod zvonkem. Nov\u00e1 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed se nezaznamen\u00e1vaj\u00ed."],"The history is filled by the panel under the bell in the admin bar. While notices are not hidden there, nothing new is recorded.":["Historii pln\u00ed panel pod zvonkem v li\u0161t\u011b administrace. Dokud tam upozorn\u011bn\u00ed neskr\u00fdv\u00e1te, nic nov\u00e9ho se nezaznamen\u00e1v\u00e1."],"Open the settings":["Otev\u0159\u00edt nastaven\u00ed"],"No notices recorded yet":["Zat\u00edm nebylo zaznamen\u00e1no \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed"],"Notices that WordPress and plugins show in the admin appear here after they land in the panel under the bell.":["Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed, kter\u00e1 WordPress a pluginy zobrazuj\u00ed v administraci, se tu objev\u00ed pot\u00e9, co skon\u010d\u00ed v panelu pod zvonkem."],"Turn on hiding of admin notices with the panel under the bell and they will be collected here.":["Zapn\u011bte skr\u00fdv\u00e1n\u00ed upozorn\u011bn\u00ed s panelem pod zvonkem a budou se sem ukl\u00e1dat."],"Delete the whole notice history? This cannot be undone.":["Smazat celou historii upozorn\u011bn\u00ed? Nelze to vr\u00e1tit zp\u011bt."],"Clear all history":["Vymazat celou historii"],"Search notices":["Hledat upozorn\u011bn\u00ed"],"Search title and text\u2026":["Hledat v nadpisu a textu\u2026"],"All sources":["V\u0161echny zdroje"],"Period":["Obdob\u00ed"],"Reset filters":["Zru\u0161it filtry"],"Select all on this page":["Vybrat v\u0161e na t\u00e9to str\u00e1nce"],"%d notice":["%d upozorn\u011bn\u00ed","%d upozorn\u011bn\u00ed","%d upozorn\u011bn\u00ed"],"Delete %d selected record?":["Smazat %d vybran\u00fd z\u00e1znam?","Smazat %d vybran\u00e9 z\u00e1znamy?","Smazat %d vybran\u00fdch z\u00e1znam\u016f?"],"No notices match the filters":["\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e1 upozorn\u011bn\u00ed neodpov\u00eddaj\u00ed filtr\u016fm"],"A notice that has not been seen for %1$d days is marked as gone. Records are kept for %2$d days after the last sighting (at most 1000).":["Upozorn\u011bn\u00ed, kter\u00e9 nebylo vid\u011bt %1$d dn\u00ed, se ozna\u010d\u00ed jako zmizel\u00e9. Z\u00e1znamy se uchov\u00e1vaj\u00ed %2$d dn\u00ed od posledn\u00edho zobrazen\u00ed (nejv\u00fd\u0161e 1000)."]}}}